            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "The Gift; Hermetic Magus; Celestial Magic, Major Magical Focus (Cloth); Hermetic Numerology, Hermetic Geometry, Inventive Genius, Items of Quality, Puissant Artes Liberales, Puissant Magic Theory, Puissant Finesse, Self-Confident, Verditius Magic; Weak Spontaneous Magic, Enemies (Solar Magnus); Difficult Spontaneous Magic, Driven (Find the lost works), Hubris, Infamous, Slow Caster"
